### 2. External Alerts Dispatcher (Telegram & Webhook)
#### [MODIFY] [server.js](file:///c:/Users/TEJAS%20KUMAR%20DEWANGAN/OneDrive/Desktop/New%20folder/server.js)
- Add endpoints:
  - `GET /api/alerts/config`: Retrieve saved alert settings (Telegram bot token, chat ID, webhook URL, secret token).
  - `POST /api/alerts/config`: Save alert configurations to local state / storage.
  - `POST /api/alerts/test-telegram`: Send a live formatted test alert message to Telegram via `https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/sendMessage`.
  - `POST /api/alerts/test-webhook`: Send a JSON payload POST test to the user's Webhook URL (Tradetron / Custom Python Bot / Broker API).
  - `POST /api/alerts/dispatch`: Trigger real-time notifications with stock matches and technical triggers when a scan runs.

